      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tested with Freedom Mobile (freedom/nationwide, roaming, 5g, volte, mms, etc) and fixes all issues with it.\n\nShould not cause issues with any carriers; I\u0027ve done a lot of research and put effort into ensuring they\u0027re correct. I don\u0027t have the ability to test them though.\n\nSee [github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff](https://github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff) for some random stuff related to my research on this.\n\nFor a more readable form for reviewing, see:\n- [xml: grouped and commented by carrier](https://github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff/blob/177c6b9d469165f3d9f9193e48d30e1351476196/mcc302.xml)\n- [diff: aosp vs lineage vs google vs mine](https://htmlpreview.github.io/?https://github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff/blob/177c6b9d469165f3d9f9193e48d30e1351476196/experiments/curated/diff.html)\n- [diff: google vs mine](https://htmlpreview.github.io/?https://github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff/blob/177c6b9d469165f3d9f9193e48d30e1351476196/experiments/curated/diff1.html)\n- [diff: lineage vs mine](https://htmlpreview.github.io/?https://github.com/pgaskin/apnstuff/blob/177c6b9d469165f3d9f9193e48d30e1351476196/experiments/curated/diff2.html)",
